==Increasing Movement Speed==
{{Main|Movement Speed}}

Movement speed buffs will increase how fast a Warframe moves while sprinting (but not the Sprint Speed stat itself) since the Sprint Speed modifier applies to movement speed.
{{Transclude|Movement Speed#Increasing Movement Speed}}

==Flight Speed==
{{for|flight speed in regards to weapons|Projectile Speed}}

'''Flight Speed''' is the [[Archwing]] equivalent to Sprint Speed and it determines how fast Archwings move while [[Archwing Maneuvers#Dashing|Dashing]].

